{"transcript":"luruh","exists":true,"definitions":["Berguguran (tentang daun, bunga, buah, rambut, dsb); rontok.","Melorot (tentang pakaian, celana, dsb).","Gugur (tentang gigi, jabatan, dsb)."],"examples":["Daun-daun kering mulai luruh dari pohonnya.","Pakaiannya luruh karena terlalu longgar.","Gigi susunya sudah luruh semua."],"lemma":"luruh","lemmaPos":"verb","synonyms":["rontok","gugur","melorot"],"number":"singular","tense":"present","source":"luruh"}